      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Who checks what",
      "items": [
        "Bridge: argument models and the plain-http refusal",
        "nginx (prod): basic auth, then injects X-API-Key",
        "Backend: guard, require_api_key, then the limiter"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "One tool per store",
      "items": [
        "search_code goes to Algolia via AlgoliaService",
        "The other tools read SQLite through SQLAlchemy"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Errors stay tool results",
      "items": [
        "401, 404, 422, 429 and 5xx map to messages in _http_error",
        "A ToolError returns 200 with is_error true",
        "Unreachable means one retry, then a tool error"
      ]
